          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="M" typeId="da3c-fb2b-4c5f-a22b">3</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="WS" typeId="d46f-1ae5-387f-4ac3">4</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="BS" typeId="22c7-799b-e07c-f32c">5</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="S" typeId="0c58-1252-962d-8fcc">4</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="T" typeId="16d7-9f22-06d8-8427">4</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="W" typeId="f9d0-a5b0-7e0b-a404">2</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="I" typeId="b418-0e30-644f-1435">2</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="A" typeId="fa03-f9a3-8117-98dd">2</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Ld" typeId="bbad-d421-400b-87c1">9</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <rules>
        <rule id="af20-0eac-69e7-18f7" name="Artillery Master" hidden="false">
          <description>If the Master Engineer joins a Bolt Thrower you may use his BS. If he joins a Grudge Thrower you may re-roll the Artillery dice (but not the Scatter dice) when firing it. If he joins a Cannon, it inflicts D6 wounds per hit instead of D3.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="fb11-a897-c570-9a03" name="Entrenchment" hidden="false">
          <description>One war machine (not a Gyrocopter) per Master Engineer in the army may be entrenched. It counts as in hard cover when shot at and as behind a defended obstacle in close combat. It may pivot to fire, but the entrenchment is lost if it moves in any other way or is destroyed.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
      <infoLinks>
