            <characteristic name="I" typeId="b418-0e30-644f-1435">2</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="A" typeId="fa03-f9a3-8117-98dd">1</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Ld" typeId="bbad-d421-400b-87c1">9</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <rules>
        <rule id="14c4-60b9-21bc-7bb7" name="Organ Gun" hidden="false">
          <description>Range 24&quot;, Strength 5, -3 armour save. Moves at the speed of its crew as for Cannons; cannot move and shoot in the same turn other than to pivot. Affected by loss of crew.

Nominate a target, turn to face it and roll the Artillery dice, then measure: if in range the target suffers hits equal to the score. You may re-roll the Artillery dice if it did not score a Misfire; a Misfire on the re-roll counts as Fzzz... Clunk.

Misfire (roll a D6):
1-2: Destroyed! Remove the Organ Gun and its crew.
3-4: Malfunction. The gun cannot fire this turn or next turn.
5-6: Fzzz... Clunk. The gun does not fire this turn but may fire as normal next turn.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
      <infoLinks>
        <infoLink id="9f39-008e-05d4-1981" name="Gunners&apos; Pride" hidden="false" targetId="5a6b-b805-0d7d-6978" type="rule"/>
      </infoLinks>
      <categoryLinks>
        <categoryLink id="0096-830d-8f22-99b7" name="Rare" hidden="false" targetId="a3af-995e-0cf1-7091" primary="true"/>
      </categoryLinks>
