      </profiles>
      <rules>
        <rule id="0f22-4554-ddaf-c2f2" name="Flame Cannon" hidden="false">
          <description>Moves at the speed of its crew as for Cannons, and may pivot to face its target, but cannot otherwise move and fire in the same turn. Affected by loss of crew.

Range 12&quot;, Strength 5, D3 wounds, -2 armour save. Declare a distance up to 12&quot; and roll the Artillery dice: the jet travels that total distance. Place the Flame template with its narrow end where the jet lands, pointing directly away from the cannon. Models fully under it are hit, those partially under are hit on a 4+. Each hit is Strength 5; each wound becomes D3 wounds. A unit that suffers casualties must take an immediate Panic test.

Misfire (roll a D6):
1: Destroyed! The Flame Cannon is destroyed and its crew slain.
2-3: Malfunction. The Flame Cannon may not shoot this turn or next turn.
4-6: Phut. The Flame Cannon may not fire this turn.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
