        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <rules>
        <rule id="d1d4-b790-0c71-c2ad" name="Gyrocopter" hidden="false">
          <description>Unit Strength 3. Counts as a war machine only for spells and magic effects that specifically affect war machines. Deploys as a separate unit, not necessarily with other war machines. Otherwise treated as a flying monster. If it cannot fly, it cannot move. If it flees as a charge reaction and rallies at the start of its next turn, it may reform to face any direction and move, but may not shoot or charge. 4+ armour save.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="249c-d762-d5bb-9fe4" name="Steam Gun" hidden="false">
          <description>Place the Flame template with the broad end over the target and the narrow end at the gun&apos;s muzzle. Models fully under it are hit, those partially under are hit on a 4+. Strength 3, armour save modifier -1. May not be used to Stand &amp; Shoot.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
      <infoLinks>
        <infoLink id="575f-c58d-494e-155a" name="Fly" hidden="false" targetId="87db-2d4c-3fa6-6a26" type="rule"/>
      </infoLinks>
